            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Cato the Elder's Early Life</strong><br>\nCato the Elder was born in 234 BCE in the Roman territory of Tusculum. He was born into a plebeian, or commoner, family, which shaped his robust values and strong work ethic. As a young man, he served in the Roman army and was known for his bravery and discipline. This military experience laid the foundation for his later political and social career, emphasizing traditional Roman virtues.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Rise to Roman Politics</strong><br>\nAfter his military service, Cato quickly rose through the ranks of Roman politics. He held various political positions, starting with the role of Quaestor, which was an entry-level political role similar to a treasurer. Cato was elected as Consul in 195 BCE, the highest office in the Roman Republic. His term as Consul was marked by a frugal public policy and promotion of simplicity and austerity.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Advocacy for Traditional Roman Values</strong><br>\nCato the Elder was known for his staunch conservatism and his defense of traditional Roman values. He opposed the Hellenization of Roman culture, advocating for the simplicity and severity of older Roman customs. He viewed the luxury and art of Greek culture as a threat to the moral and military discipline that made Rome great.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
